// An un-annotated function delivered as a value at `(a: i32) => i32`, then called directly at
// `f64` after the delivery. Each use is its own instance, so the later call must not re-type the
// delivery: `v(4) / 2` divides as an integer (2) and the direct call adds as a float (4.5), so
// the sum is 6.5 only when both keep their own types (D9031).
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/README.md, "Template format".
// @@PRELUDE@@
function __inc(a) { return a + 1 }
// @@VALUE@@
__inc
// @@TYPE@@
(a: i32) => i32
// @@PROOF@@
print(__inc(3.5) + v(4) / 2)
// @@WANT@@
6.5
